{
  "schema_version": "prompt-runtime.program-scenario.v1",
  "story_path": "user_stories/screen-design-check.md",
  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "AC1",
      "text": "When `app-map.json` has `\"stylesheets\": []` for HTML screen `\"ledger\"` whose prompt `prompts/ledger_screen.prompt.md` links `prompts/views/ledger__stacked.ui.svg`, lint warns `Warning: SVG layout app-map.json -> prompts/ledger_screen.prompt.md: stylesheets: HTML screen \"ledger\" links prompts/views/ledger__stacked.ui.svg with no stylesheet in \"stylesheets\".`"
    },
    {
      "id": "AC2",
      "text": "When `app-map.json` lists `styles/pocket.css` defining `.btn-primary` and `.ledger-card` and `prompts/ledger_screen.prompt.md` names no class from `styles/pocket.css`, lint warns `Warning: SVG layout prompts/ledger_screen.prompt.md -> styles/pocket.css: stylesheet classes: HTML screen \"ledger\" links prompts/views/ledger__stacked.ui.svg and names no CSS class from its stylesheet (for example .btn-primary).`, and emits 0 warnings once the prompt names `.ledger-card`."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC3",
      "text": "Comparing a rendered screen with `--look` against a `#0f172a` canvas and two stacked `#1e293b` cards (`#balance-card` at `388×68` and `#entry-list` at `388×74`, `12px` apart) passes when the screen has a `#111827` canvas and painted `380×66` and `380×72` `#1e293b` cards `14px` apart, without requiring pixel equality."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC4",
      "text": "Comparing that same screen with `--look` when its stylesheet is dropped fails with status `look` on the `#ffffff` canvas and the unpainted `#balance-card` and `#entry-list` boxes (`unpainted box` and `unpainted box; gap 0px`)."
    }
  ],
  "initial_world": {},
  "simulation": {},
  "context": [],
  "steps": [
    {
